OL,3,GNEWSASix years, hundreds of plants and
OL,4,Aone tree casualty - Edinburgh's Palm
OL,5,AHouse returns
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfter six years and an unprecedented
OL,8,Fbotanical operation, Edinburgh's famous
OL,9,FPalm Houses are back.
OL,11,FThe historic glasshouses at the Royal
OL,12,FBotanic Garden have been closed to the
OL,13,Fpublic for vital restoration work.
OL,15,FHundreds of plants had to be
OL,16,Ftemporarily moved while repairs were
OL,17,Fdone on the 19th century buildings -
OL,18,Fthe vast majority of them surviving the
OL,19,Fexperience.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
